        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Paris/_scene_paris.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 64c391f7-4765-48b6-96bc-df8aa5a4186b).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47. Welcome to Paris.\r\rWe tracked down another member of the illegal business with Morocco&apos;s national treasures.\rYour second target is Sebastian Sato - the lead fashion designer of Sanguine. Sato uses fashion shows as a cover to export artifacts from Morocco. Tonight he is having a fashion show at Palais de Walewska.\rOur client wanna end the life of these smugglers in a specific way - a saber way.\r\rGood Luck, 47.",
